  "evidence": "TEXT_G: Pledges a UK-wide second EU referendum with Remain on the ballot; an NHS Protection Act and call for UK per‑capita NHS spending to match Scotland’s; end austerity and invest in services; scrap the benefit freeze, two‑child cap and sanctions; protect the state pension triple lock; employment and workers’ rights reforms. TEXT_C: Centres on a Green New Deal to hit net zero by 2030; rapid renewables expansion, home insulation, and transport overhaul; Universal Basic Income; extensive environmental, animal, and drug policy reforms; supports Remain via a People’s Vote but as one plank among many.",
